Subject: [PATCH] realtek: update PSE polling and lifecycle support

Backport the complete PSE polling, controller lifecycle and LED support
from OpenWrt 5799d2da76998be50432b0a3325b42713b4b619b, including
32-bit bitmap and teardown fixes. Keep PHY, MDIO and ethtool lifecycle
handling consistent with the updated PSE core.

Signed-off-by: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>

